<title>UK: BP sets May LPG price at $155/$156 a tonne.</title>
<headline>BP sets May LPG price at $155/$156 a tonne.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>British Petroleum has announced its May price for Liquefied Petroleum Gas (LPG), the BP Agreed Price or BPAP.</p>
<p>The propane price will be $155 a tonne, down by $17 a tonne from the April level of $172 a tonne. Butane will be $156 a tonne, down by $19 a tonne from April's $175 a tonne. The price is effective from May 1.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom, +44 171 542 6412</p>
</text>
